          "THE TRACKER I SEWED INTO HER JACKET JUST PINGED - FROM SPACE. SOMEONE IS TAKING HER OFF THE PLANET."
        ],
        [
          "TO FOLLOW HER I NEED A SHIP. I'VE BEEN BUILDING ONE IN THE GARAGE FOR YEARS. IT'S ALMOST DONE."
        ],
        [
          "ALMOST. THE ENGINE STILL NEEDS ONE PART I COULD NEVER GET. GOODCO KEEPS IT IN THEIR CLEANROOM VAULT."
        ],
