          "I KNOW, BECAUSE I WORKED THERE. I BUILT THEIR ENGINES - TILL AN AI LEARNED MY JOB AND THEY FIRED ME."
        ],
        [
          "THE WHOLE BLOCK LOST ITS JOBS THE SAME WAY. NOW WE ALL LIVE ON WELFARE AND MOVIE NIGHTS."
