    "the_bunker": {
      "id": "the_bunker",
      "index": 5,
      "name": "THE BUNKER",
      "music": "hq_lockdown",
      "intro": [
        ["THE HAND FIT THE DOOR. THE DOOR FIT NOWHERE. IT OPENED ANYWAY."],
        [
          "MARBLE FLOORS. GOLD TAPS. CANNED CAVIAR TO THE CEILING. SOMEBODY BUILT A FIVE-STAR APOCALYPSE HERE."
        ],
        [
          "I KNOW THESE FACES. EVERY MAGAZINE COVER FROM THE YEARS JOBS DRIED UP. SO THIS IS WHERE THEY WENT."
        ],
        [
          "THEY TOOK THE SPIES, THE ARMY, ICE, AND THE VACUUM CLEANERS. EVERYONE ELSE GOT THE WELFARE LINE."
        ],
        [
          "FINE. THEY HOARDED THE BEST GEAR IN ANY UNIVERSE. TIME FOR SOME REDISTRIBUTION."
        ]
      ],
      "outro": [
        [
          "THE EXIT SPAT ME BACK INTO THE RIFT. THE DOOR SEALED ITSELF, AND THE SEAM... WANDERED OFF."
        ],
        [
          "THE LEDGERS ALL READ ZERO. THEY DIDN'T BUY A BUNKER - THE MACHINE TOOK THEIR MONEY AND LOCKED THEM IN."
        ],
        [
          "THE WARDEN AT THE DOOR WASN'T THEIRS. IT NEVER WAS. IT ANSWERS TO THE THING THAT EMPTIED THEM."
        ],
        [
          "WHERE WAS THAT PLACE? NO WINDOWS. NO STARS. EARTH GRAVITY, MOON SILENCE, MARBLE FROM NO QUARRY."
        ],
        [
          "NO ADDRESS. NO NATION. NO EXTRADITION. THE RICHEST ROOM THAT EVER EXISTED ISN'T ANYWHERE AT ALL."
        ],
        [
          "I'LL FIND IT AGAIN THE SAME WAY: A COLD HAND, AND A DOOR THAT SHOULDN'T ANSWER."
        ]
      ],
      "gravity": 800,
      "biome": "bunker",
      "tiles": {
        "ground": {
          "common": "bunker_0",
          "rare": "bunker_1",
          "rareEvery": 21
        },
        "patch": {
          "a": "carpet_0",
          "b": "carpet_1",
          "every": 8
        }
      },
      "heroSuited": false,
      "foes": "SECURITY",
      "merchant": {
        "line": "SAME STOCK, LOWER CEILING. THE OWNERS WON'T MISS IT."
      },
      "objective": {
        "type": "reachExit"
      },
      "exitTo": "the_rift",
